DTSTAMP:20261005T235648Z
UID:fleetweeksf-52853-20261010@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Air Show
DESCRIPTION:Held annually between the Golden Gate Bridge and Alcatraz\, th
 e San Francisco Fleet Week Air Show Presented by United Airlines brings wo
 rld-class aviation to one of the most iconic settings in the world.\n\nAt 
 the heart of the Air Show is Marina Green\, home to the Marina Green Festi
 val Center. General Admission is free. Unbeatable waterfront hospitality i
 s available through the Air Show Network VIP Experience.\n\nHeadlined by t
 he U.S. Navy Blue Angels\, the Air Show is also the only show in the Unite
 d States to feature a commercial airliner\, the United 777\, performing a 
 fully choreographed aerial demonstration over the Bay.\n\nDetails: https:/
 /fleetweeksf.org/air-show/\nSource: SF Fleet Week (fleetweeksf.org)
